- 1099-NEC / invoices / bank records showing the $12,500 client income
- Receipts for business expenses and for the $780 (if business-related)
- Lease agreement / rent statements to support the rent paid and home-office share
- Charity receipt for the $800 donation
- 1098-E or lender statement for student loan interest showing $3,600
- 1099-INTs (Chase, Schwab) for interest income

