  - Home-office (actual method): rent portion = (100 sq ft / 690 sq ft) × $2,400 × 12 = about $4,176
  - Other business expenses (if the $780 is business-related): $780
  - Net self-employment income ≈ 12,500 − 4,176 − 780 = ≈ $7,543
