4) Key federal forms you’ll need
- Form 1040 (main return)
- Schedule 1 (Additional Income and Adjustments to Income) — student loan interest deduction and half SE tax appear here as adjustments
- Schedule C (Profit or Loss from Business) — report the web-design revenue and business expenses
- Schedule SE (Self-Employment Tax) — calculates SE tax and the half-SE deduction
- Form 8829 (Expenses for Business Use of Your Home) — if you use the actual home-office method; not needed for simplified method
