6) Unreimbursed expenses ($780)
- If these are unreimbursed employee expenses (for an employer W‑2 job), they are NOT deductible for tax years 2018–2025 under current law.  
- If they are ordinary and necessary expenses of your self‑employment (web‑design business), report them on Schedule C as business expenses.

