Details and math help

1) Standard deduction vs. itemizing
- 2024 standard deduction (Married Filing Jointly): $29,200.
- Your clearly identified itemized items: charitable gift = $800. You didn’t list mortgage interest, property tax, or large state/local tax payments. With only $800 in charitable contributions and (apparently) no other large itemized items, the standard deduction will almost certainly be larger.
